    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d440">

                <pb facs="0708" n="690" xml:id="pg690"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.51/1–3047: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-01-30T21:00:00+01:00">January 30, 1947—9
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>411. Embassy informed that at Finance Ministry meeting this afternoon under
                    chairmanship Finance Minister Schuman, decision was made for Baumgartner,
                    President Crédit National, to proceed immediately to Washington in connection
                    French application International Bank loan. He is scheduled to take plane this
                        Sunday.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d440-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Meeting was reportedly called as result of telephone call this morning from
                    French alternate director International Bank, who reported that McCloy<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d440-f2"/> appointment presidence [<hi rendition="#italic">as
                        president</hi>] was imminent.</p>
                <p>Mendès-France, French executive director International Bank, is planning to leave
                    for Washington some time next week.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d440-f1" n="1" xml:id="d440-f1-content">
                <p>February 2.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d440-f2" n="2" xml:id="d440-f2-content">
                <p>The election of John J. McCloy as President of the International Bank for
                    Reconstruction and Development was announced on February 28, 1947.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
